@startuml

participant mosaik
participant Simosaik
participant SIMONA

== Setup ==

mosaik -> SIMONA: starts SIMONA via cmd
activate SIMONA

SIMONA -> Simosaik: initializes
deactivate SIMONA

activate Simosaik
Simosaik -> mosaik: connects

Simosaik -> mosaik: meta data
mosaik -> Simosaik: create entities

Simosaik -> mosaik: entities
deactivate Simosaik

== Simulation ==

mosaik -> Simosaik: step at time t with input data
activate Simosaik

Simosaik -> Simosaik: converts input data
Simosaik -> SIMONA: sends input data

activate SIMONA
Simosaik -> SIMONA: requests results

deactivate Simosaik
SIMONA -> Simosaik: result data

deactivate SIMONA
activate Simosaik

Simosaik -> Simosaik: converts result data
Simosaik -> mosaik: return t + step_size

deactivate Simosaik
mosaik -> Simosaik: get_data

activate Simosaik
Simosaik -> mosaik: return result data

deactivate Simosaik


@enduml